
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Customer
    actor Agent
    participant App as PayLink App
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Fee as Fee Calculator
    participant Validator as Validation Service
    participant Wallet as Wallet Service
    participant Ledger as Ledger Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant Adapter as Biller Adapter
    participant Biller as External Biller
    participant Requery as Requery Scheduler
    participant Callback as Callback Handler
    participant Commission as Commission Service
    participant Notification as Notification Service
    participant SMS as SMS Provider
    participant Push as Push Provider
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    %% 1. Browse billers and services
    Customer->>App: Open Pay a Bill
    App->>DB: Get active billers and services
    DB-->>App: Return billers, services and required fields
    App-->>Customer: Display billers and required input fields

    %% 2. Select service and enter bill information
    Customer->>App: Select biller and service
    App-->>Customer: Display required bill information fields 
    Customer->>App: Enter bill reference and required details

    %% 3. Bill inquiry
    App->>Payment: Request bill inquiry
    Payment->>Validator: Validate service and biller status
    Validator->>DB: Check biller and service configuration
    DB-->>Validator: Return configuration

    alt Biller or service is inactive
        Validator-->>Payment: Validation failed
        Payment-->>App: Return unavailable service error
        App-->>Customer: Display error
    else Biller and service are active
        Payment->>Adapter: Send bill inquiry
        Adapter->>Biller: Inquiry request using biller protocol

        alt Biller responds within 10 seconds
            Biller-->>Adapter: Bill inquiry response
            Adapter-->>Payment: Bill details and status

            alt Bill is already paid or expired
                Payment-->>App: Reject inquiry
                App-->>Customer: Display bill unavailable message
            else Bill is valid
                Payment->>Fee: Calculate service fee
                Fee->>DB: Get applicable fee and promotion
                DB-->>Fee: Return fee configuration

                alt Electricity or water
                    Fee->>Fee: Apply fixed fee of 2.50 EGP
                else Mobile top-up
                    Fee->>Fee: Calculate 1.5% with minimum 1 EGP
                else Internet bill
                    Fee->>Fee: Apply 2 EGP up to 200 EGP, otherwise 4 EGP
                end

                opt Active promotion exists
                    Fee->>Fee: Set service fee to 0 EGP
                end

                Fee->>Fee: Round fee to 2 decimals using Round Half Up
                Fee-->>Payment: Return service fee
                Payment-->>App: Return bill amount, fee and total
                App-->>Customer: Display bill details and total amount

                %% 4. Confirm payment
                Customer->>App: Confirm payment
                App->>Payment: Submit payment request and idempotency key

                %% 5. Idempotency check
                Payment->>DB: Check customer, endpoint and idempotency key

                alt Duplicate request with same payload
                    DB-->>Payment: Existing payment found
                    Payment-->>App: Return existing payment result
                    App-->>Customer: Display existing payment status
                else Key reused with different payload
                    DB-->>Payment: Request hash mismatch
                    Payment-->>App: Reject conflicting request
                    App-->>Customer: Display idempotency error
                else New idempotency key
                    DB-->>Payment: Key is available

                    %% 6. Validate customer and payment attempts
                    Payment->>Validator: Validate customer and payment

                    Validator->>DB: Check account status and verification level
                    DB-->>Validator: Return account information

                    alt Account is blocked
                        Validator-->>Payment: Account blocked
                        Payment-->>App: Reject payment
                        App-->>Customer: Display account blocked message
                    else Account is active
                        Validator->>DB: Count payment attempts in last 60 seconds
                        DB-->>Validator: Return attempt count

                        alt More than 5 attempts within 60 seconds
                            Validator->>DB: Block account for 10 minutes
                            Validator->>Audit: Record temporary account block
                            Validator-->>Payment: Velocity limit exceeded
                            Payment-->>App: Reject payment
                            App-->>Customer: Display temporary block message
                        else 5 or fewer attempts
                            Validator->>DB: Record payment attempt
                            Validator->>DB: Get global, service and daily limits
                            DB-->>Validator: Return applicable limits

                            alt Amount below 5 EGP or above 10,000 EGP
                                Validator-->>Payment: Single payment limit exceeded
                                Payment-->>App: Reject payment
                                App-->>Customer: Display single payment limit error
                            else Amount exceeds service-specific limits
                                Validator-->>Payment: Service amount limit exceeded
                                Payment-->>App: Reject payment
                                App-->>Customer: Display service limit error
                            else Mobile top-up amount below 10 EGP
                                Validator-->>Payment: Top-up minimum not satisfied
                                Payment-->>App: Reject payment
                                App-->>Customer: Display top-up minimum error
                            else Amount is within single payment limits
                                alt Basic account daily total exceeds 5,000 EGP
                                    Validator-->>Payment: Daily limit exceeded
                                    Payment-->>App: Reject payment
                                    App-->>Customer: Display Basic daily limit error
                                else Verified account daily total exceeds 30,000 EGP
                                    Validator-->>Payment: Daily limit exceeded
                                    Payment-->>App: Reject payment
                                    App-->>Customer: Display Verified daily limit error
                                else Payment is within all limits
                                    Validator-->>Payment: Validation successful

                                    %% 7. Create payment and hold funds
                                    Payment->>DB: Create payment with status FundsHeld
                                    Payment->>Wallet: Hold total amount including fee
                                    Wallet->>DB: Recheck available balance

                                    alt Insufficient available balance
                                        DB-->>Wallet: Insufficient balance
                                        Wallet-->>Payment: Hold failed
                                        Payment->>DB: Mark payment Rejected
                                        Payment-->>App: Payment rejected
                                        App-->>Customer: Display insufficient balance
                                    else Sufficient available balance
                                        DB-->>Wallet: Balance available
                                        Wallet->>Ledger: Record hold entries
                                        Note over Wallet,Ledger: Hold and release entries share a transaction ID and are saved atomically
                                        Ledger->>DB: Save hold ledger entries
                                        DB-->>Ledger: Hold recorded
                                        Ledger-->>Wallet: Hold successful
                                        Wallet-->>Payment: Funds held successfully
                                        Payment->>Audit: Record money hold
                                        Payment->>DB: Save idempotency key and payment reference

                                        %% 8. Send payment to biller
                                        Payment->>DB: Update status to SentToBiller
                                        Payment->>Adapter: Send payment request
                                        Adapter->>Biller: Payment request

                                        alt Biller confirms payment synchronously
                                            Biller-->>Adapter: Payment successful
                                            Adapter-->>Payment: Success response
                                            Payment->>DB: Validate state transition
                                            Payment->>DB: Update status to Completed
                                            Payment->>Wallet: Finalize held amount
                                            Wallet->>Ledger: Record final charge and fee entries
                                            Ledger->>DB: Save charge ledger entries
                                            Payment->>Audit: Record charge and fee income

                                            opt Payment initiated by an agent
                                                Payment->>Commission: Calculate 40% of service fee
                                                Commission->>DB: Credit agent wallet
                                                Commission->>Audit: Record agent commission
                                            end

                                            Payment->>Notification: Send payment success notification
                                            Notification->>SMS: Send SMS with amount and reference
                                            Notification->>Push: Send push notification
                                            Notification->>DB: Save notification status

                                            opt Notification delivery fails
                                                loop Up to 3 retries after first attempt
                                                    Notification->>SMS: Retry sending notification
                                                    SMS-->>Notification: Delivery result
                                                end
                                                Notification->>DB: Mark Undelivered if all attempts fail
                                            end

                                            Payment-->>App: Payment completed
                                            App-->>Customer: Display successful payment

                                        else Biller refuses payment
                                            Biller-->>Adapter: Payment refused with reason
                                            Adapter-->>Payment: Failure response
                                            Payment->>DB: Validate state transition
                                            Payment->>DB: Update status to Failed
                                            Payment->>Wallet: Release held amount
                                            Wallet->>Ledger: Record hold release entries
                                            Ledger->>DB: Save release entries
                                            Payment->>DB: Update status to Refunded
                                            Payment->>Audit: Record hold release
                                            Payment->>Notification: Send failure notification
                                            Notification->>SMS: Send failure SMS with reason
                                            Notification->>Push: Send failure push notification
                                            Payment-->>App: Payment failed
                                            App-->>Customer: Display failure reason

                                        else Biller does not respond within 10 seconds
                                            Payment->>DB: Update status to Unknown
                                            Payment->>Requery: Schedule re-queries
                                            Note over Payment,Wallet: Held funds remain held. No automatic refund or release.
                                            Payment->>Notification: Notify customer payment is processing
                                            Notification->>SMS: Send processing notification
                                            Notification->>Push: Send processing notification
                                            Payment-->>App: Payment status Unknown
                                            App-->>Customer: Your payment is being processed

                                            %% 9. Re-query process
                                            loop Re-query after 1, 5 and 15 minutes (up to 3 attempts)
                                                Requery->>DB: Get original payment reference
                                                Requery->>Adapter: Re-query original payment
                                                Adapter->>Biller: Check payment status

                                                alt Biller confirms payment
                                                    Biller-->>Adapter: Success
                                                    Adapter-->>Requery: Payment confirmed
                                                    Requery->>Payment: Resolve payment as Completed
                                                    Payment->>DB: Update status to Completed
                                                    Payment->>Wallet: Finalize held amount
                                                    Wallet->>Ledger: Record final charge
                                                    Ledger->>DB: Save charge entry
                                                    Payment->>Audit: Record final charge
                                                    Payment->>Notification: Send success notification
                                                    Payment-->>App: Payment completed
                                                else Biller refuses payment
                                                    Biller-->>Adapter: Failed
                                                    Adapter-->>Requery: Payment refused
                                                    Requery->>Payment: Resolve payment as Failed
                                                    Payment->>DB: Update status to Failed
                                                    Payment->>Wallet: Release held amount
                                                    Wallet->>Ledger: Record release entries
                                                    Ledger->>DB: Save release entries
                                                    Payment->>DB: Update status to Refunded
                                                    Payment->>Audit: Record hold release
                                                    Payment->>Notification: Send failure notification
                                                    Payment-->>App: Payment failed and refunded
                                                else No response
                                                    Biller-->>Adapter: No response
                                                    Adapter-->>Requery: No result
                                                    Requery->>DB: Save re-query attempt
                                                    Note over Requery,Payment: Continue to next scheduled attempt
                                                end
                                            end

                                            opt All 3 re-queries receive no answer
                                                Requery->>DB: Keep payment status Unknown
                                                Requery->>DB: Wait for reconciliation
                                                Note over Payment,Wallet: Keep funds held. Do not create another payment for the same bill.
                                            end
                                        end
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        else Inquiry timeout or unavailable biller
            Adapter-->>Payment: Inquiry timeout or failure
            Payment-->>App: Inquiry failed
            App-->>Customer: Display inquiry error
            Note over Customer,App: Customer must manually retry the inquiry
        end
    end

    %% 10. TopUpNet asynchronous callback
    opt TopUpNet sends asynchronous callback
        Biller->>Callback: Callback with payment reference and result
        Callback->>DB: Find payment by reference

        alt Payment reference not found
            DB-->>Callback: No payment found
            Callback-->>Biller: Payment reference not found
            Callback->>Audit: Log callback with unknown reference
        else Payment found
            DB-->>Callback: Return payment and current status

            alt Callback arrives before SentToBiller
                Callback->>Audit: Log and ignore early callback
            else Payment already Completed, Refunded or Rejected
                Callback->>Audit: Log duplicate or conflicting callback
                Note over Callback,Payment: Ignore callback. Do not change balance or create ledger entries.
            else Callback result is success and payment is SentToBiller or Unknown
                Callback->>Payment: Resolve payment as Completed
                Payment->>DB: Validate state transition
                Payment->>DB: Update status to Completed
                Payment->>Wallet: Finalize held amount
                Wallet->>Ledger: Record final charge exactly once
                Ledger->>DB: Save charge entry
                Payment->>Audit: Record final charge
                Payment->>Notification: Send success notification
            else Callback result is failed and payment is SentToBiller or Unknown
                Callback->>Payment: Resolve payment as Failed
                Payment->>DB: Validate state transition
                Payment->>DB: Update status to Failed
                Payment->>Wallet: Release held amount
                Wallet->>Ledger: Record release entries
                Ledger->>DB: Save release entries
                Payment->>DB: Update status to Refunded
                Payment->>Audit: Record hold release
                Payment->>Notification: Send failure notification
            end
        end
    end
